{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_title", "source_sha256": "41afa4997e69a02f2efe9653afb83e4c9b3292f0dd3494eb755f0fb9755380e0", "ja": "カモンカモン、コールマイネーム！", "zh": "Come on Come on，Call my name！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_synopsis", "source_sha256": "65f959574ca4e7cb42989661805b69802f243d24ad0c83789acbefc49bf01f40", "ja": "テーマパークの仕事に、自ら立候補する茜。\nだがキャラの被るマスコットのネコに、やり\nづらさを感じて戸惑う。プロデューサーの\nアドバイスを受けた茜は競い合うのではなく\nネコも周囲をも巻き込んで盛り上げる。", "zh": "茜毛遂自荐接下了主题乐园的工作。\n但面对人设撞车的吉祥物猫咪，她感到\n有些施展不开而不知所措。得到制作人的\n建议后，茜不再与它竞争，\n而是将猫咪与周围的人一起带动起来炒热气氛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1000_p", "source_sha256": "16bae2bcf30ed1dbdbe46dceb20a636eb842479ef577dc8e93d70a3d066dc429", "ja": "（ミリオンワールドランドでの仕事、\nいよいよ今日が初日だ）", "zh": "（在百万世界乐园的工作，今天终于要正式开始了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8e3f6f2f1db0a957a2235607da82ff9ab1b4817f3424844f8c75d9d767ae7b19", "ja": "（茜はやる気満々で、準備期間中は、積極的に\n意見を出したりもしていた。そしてメンバーは……）", "zh": "（茜干劲十足，准备期间还积极地提出了各种意见。而成员们则是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "46535d1b9d8d722feda04155f89277f1272d12128f997401d0528fa0bdd429c9", "ja": "うぅ……ひ、人がいっぱい……。いつもと違って一般の\nお客さんだと思うと、ちょっと緊張しちゃうかも……。", "zh": "呜呜……人、好多人……一想到和平时不同，来的是一般的\n客人，可能就有点紧张起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "2599fd4c18fda414263b6a6a55940b6fba4b3286d6503006024202d8f5320d65", "ja": "大丈夫だって、ゆきぴょん。\n真美と茜ちんがそろえば、兄ちゃんに金棒だかんね！", "zh": "没事的啦，雪步步。\n只要真美和茜茜联手，就如兄添棒了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8d9803f950a9140b9bbc7e7fba89023d18da59102e2e550f3dc82c2e3db1ba34", "ja": "あっ、雪歩さんと真美ちゃん、着替え終わったんだ。\nお疲れさまでーす♪", "zh": "啊，雪步小姐和真美，你们换好衣服啦。\n辛苦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "2c2fd3341d959617d88deaddb233db5810cdc0dc5390833e66c4e2c3648bd2c5", "ja": "お疲れさんです。\nふたりとも、今日はよろしくねぇ。", "zh": "辛苦啦。\n你们两个，今天也拜托了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "13385d5e0ac3e2f3f40207473efb2878079053ef017244c6fc998fe8db80d86c", "ja": "やーやー、雪歩ちゃん、真美ちゃん！\nゴメンね、忙しいのにお願いしちゃって。", "zh": "呀呀，雪步、真美！\n不好意思啊，在你们这么忙的时候拜托你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "d4ce6fe8b595cc010013888acfd8e1febe11ab760fa3ed7fb1b68f5c1a2e1578", "ja": "むしろ、お誘いありがちゅーだよ、茜ちん！\nこういう楽しいお仕事なら、いつでも大歓迎だかんね。", "zh": "反倒是要谢谢你的邀请啦，茜茜！  \n这种开心的工作，我们随时都欢迎哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ae560df41c63088697fa5d3dd08c3d83d7d16f55a64226c8b87440c3fee44b67", "ja": "茜ちゃんが、私たちを推薦してくれたんだよね。\nでも、真美ちゃんだけじゃなくて、どうして私まで？", "zh": "是小茜推荐了我们，对吧。可是，为什么不只是小真美，连我也要参加呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "ce1e843598dd18bb1e9ca64993ff5ea8627fcf4ed75e9a1bf8f46cbb93b4a481", "ja": "ふっふっふ……これこそが、鉄壁の布陣なのだよ！\n雪歩ちゃん、小さい子の相手、けっこう得意でしょ？", "zh": "呵呵呵……这才是坚不可摧的阵容！\n雪步，你挺擅长和小孩子相处的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4bd9fb74c3927d029fe3ccff24e1a7e2a86378dd6694cf8026da08899d561636", "ja": "えっ……そ、そうかな？\n得意っていうか、普通に話せるとは思うけど……。", "zh": "咦……是、是这样吗？\n与其说擅长，我只是觉得自己能正常和她们交流……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "4d17122875faa0c9ec3f8ab4e8f9a0afdf4a27e60fa2b2001f0e3d74df85ff51", "ja": "それがいいんだよ！　小さい子って、\n変に子ども扱いされるの、イヤがったりするからね♪", "zh": "这样才好嘛！小孩子有时候会讨厌被人刻意当成小孩子对待呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "95e412655deaaab9a09a28923f87d1ff67cace5a250a6c056ee831685e9590f7", "ja": "ここのメイン客層は、親子連れ！　雪歩ちゃんと\nひなたんには、お子さんをメインに相手をしてほしい！", "zh": "这里的主要客群是带孩子的家庭！雪步和小日向，你们主要负责和孩子们打交道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "f82aafb6d6314bb390e74edebb172c29fbe04a1e5a1c5ff769153d39b5460f2c", "ja": "そして翼ちゃんは若者向けで、真美ちゃんは参謀役……\nうむ、我ながらカンペキ！　ニャハッ☆", "zh": "然后翼负责年轻人，真美担任军师……嗯，连我自己都觉得安排得完美！喵哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b5088d37649c85291ea876f2334cfd7b1d3c9459feef2192bf21c0cabd9df4b5", "ja": "スケジュールも踏まえてるし、\n確かにいい人選だな……ちょっと悔しいくらいだ。", "zh": "连日程也考虑到了，\n确实是很合适的人选……好到让我都有点不甘心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "3a9ab1441cdd2cf98694d376b747d0a21076a8b53e6a65f88a16509ccecd2a54", "ja": "お客さんのことも、ちゃんと考えてあるんだねぇ。\nさすが、茜さんだべさ～！", "zh": "连客人也好好考虑到了呢。\n不愧是茜小姐呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8df951a74950cac91a3a97daa37dcd678a9b956ee30fb48f6da0d2b211fbc503", "ja": "（本当に茜は、能力は高いんだよな。調子にさえ\n乗らなければ……っと、打ち合わせの時間だ）", "zh": "（茜确实很有能力啊。要是不那么得意忘形就好了……等等，开会的时间到了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "bab2601344a25fe7f4e13fd71509b7e7d35a8daf8baa2d480c25c4f7e285b703", "ja": "あっ、そろそろミーティングかな？\nほらほら、みんなで会議室にレッツゴー☆", "zh": "啊，差不多该开会了吧？\n来来来，大家一起出发去会议室吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_120_1020_uneishain", "source_sha256": "be3bec08ec977aa20fb8f2376a758e05465245eda83935a82349ddd410810e01", "ja": "……ということで、みなさんにはステージでのライブや\nパレードにも参加して頂きたいと考えています。", "zh": "……事情就是这样，我希望大家不仅能登台演出，\n也能参加游行活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
